Z||000023||falconhulk||10-10-2001||09:05 AM||||Dodge Daytona Shelby Z are VERY fast cars.  Check out all the sites on them.  I am not sure which years had the 2nd gen turbos...I think it was like 87 and up.  Having the turbos rebuilt only runs about $300 US.  My brother in law has one.  It has factory tint on all windows and ttops.  Actually they are rated as one of the top 10 most wanted sports cars in the US.  The most I would pay for one would be $2500 US.  The boost can be punched up big time!  They have BIG turbos so it takes a second to spool then takes off like a rocket.  Do a search on the internet for 1/4 mile and 0 to 60 times.  I was blown away by these cars capabilities.||||reg||1
Z||000024||Neverfinished||10-10-2001||11:11 PM||||well i did it.......<BR>Took a 1988 Shelby Daytona Z for a test drive and bought it on the spot.<BR>2.2 Liter 2nd Gen turbo.... 174 horsepower.<BR>Holy ****  this thing is a rocket.<BR>I almost feel sick that I noiw have to sell my fiero. This fiero has been my first car and only car. It was a gift for my 16th birthday and I've put my heart into it. All good things must come to an end and I need a reliable 4 seater. My car has caused a little too much grief with little things that cost losts of mooney. <BR>This sux.<BR>I wish i could keep them both because my fiero is part of my life. Its been a good friend to me. Sounds cheesy but it really is sort of a friend. <P>this daytona is too good of a deal to pass up and is really really fast once the turbo spools up. T-Tops and power everything.<BR>I feel sick knowing I am selling my fiero...<BR>I love my fiero <BR>it handles too good but not enough power...<BR>By the way its only an 84 with 190000 km rebuilt 8000 ago,New tsw rims with scorchers,2000$ paint job, mustang spoiler and very loud 2000$ stereo...<P>If anyone can give words of encouragement to me about my decision to buy this fast car please do. It will help ease the pain.<P>Please don't make me feel bad about moving on from my fiero.<P>Neverfinished...............................||||reg||1
